{"nodes": [{"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_chapter10", "label": "Chapter 10 \u2014 The void", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_void", "label": "The void \u2014 void(x, y), the cells of a box that are not in \u039b", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_void_is_shadow", "label": "The void is the shadow of the exclusion principle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The excluded cells are exactly those a physical law forbids \u2014 Pauli, the hydrogenic bound, or counting. Nothing else is missing and nothing forbidden survives."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_void_free_fraction", "label": "Void-free fraction \u2014 27.7\u201330.1% across 776 million pairs, no trend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_constraint_correlation", "label": "The constraints are correlated \u2014 product 20.19%, joint 30.13%, factor 1.49", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_shared_coordinates_cause", "label": "Shared coordinates along the constraint tree \u2014 the structural cause", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The correlation is a fact about the constraint graph, not about the four physical origins: the same coordinate appears in two neighbouring constraints, so satisfying one makes its neighbour more likely to hold. The earlier 'two origins' explanation collided with Chapter 5's four physical origins and mis-stated the cause."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_time_in_lambda", "label": "\u039b carries time as an order between cells, not a stamp on one", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A date would add nothing because a transition is a type and types are not dated; what a transition can have is a predecessor and a successor."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_eighth_condition", "label": "The eighth condition k \u2265 1 \u2014 a definition, not a bound", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without it the tree collapses and twenty-five cells survive that are states rather than transitions; k \u2265 1 is the fact that \u039b's cells are transitions written as a condition."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_containment_seven_comparisons", "label": "Containment in seven comparisons \u2014 the O(1) membership test", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_tree_factorised_count", "label": "The count with no sieve \u2014 a tree has no cycles for inclusion\u2013exclusion to correct", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A general statement about indices: an index whose constraint graph is a tree has its void in closed form; one with cycles does not."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_figure_10_1", "label": "Figure 10.1 \u2014 void-free fraction across a seventeenfold range in cell count", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_mc_10_pointer", "label": "[MC-10] \u2014 the full correlation analysis in the Mathematical Compendium", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_mc_11_pointer", "label": "[MC-11] \u2014 the factorisation and the treeness proof", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_chapter10", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_chapter10_void_void", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-chapter10-void.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0